\tag{fdip}
\title{The two-cell circle and its field reflection}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{Reflection exchanges the two vertices and fixes each
unoriented edge. Reversing edge orientation and changing its
source determine the cochain reflection and its extension
to the full paired exterior algebra.}

